      "id": "claim_25a73ea35e3142b49853659f41edbd20",
      "statement": "Callidescope has no notion of a module and measures no cohesion; module spread and possibly misplaced findings were removed per ADR 0006, along with the module identity identifier and the limits that tuned them.",
