    {
      "id": "claim_4e54f50c7c0544669ebb7465681fe42d",
      "statement": "Project configurations are complete: every traced project must have a callidescope.config.ts with all four fields (entryPoints, exclude, limits, write); nothing is inherited, and projectDefaults is spread into the project's file so every number is visible. A traced project with no file or a file missing a field is refused by name.",
