      "id": "claim_61100ee6b49042b796d5541a04763cde",
      "statement": "The @callidescope/nx Nx plugin infers four targets per project (callidescope-trace, callidescope-depth, callidescope-breadth and the gate callidescope-restrict, each renameable through its TargetName option) that follow the Nx dependency graph; the gate judges only the scoped projects against their own limits, with depth always judged and breadth judged where maximumBreadth is declared.",
