      "id": "claim_8029ea1f57904a80a98003156e076d2e",
      "statement": "Callidescope's entry point rules are additive: declared addresses, framework decorators (13 defaults), exported functions from barrel files, lifecycle methods, bootstrap functions, and orphan promotion (callables with no callers), which is a safety net against missing rules silently removing subtrees.",
